# The step keys: hold a step and tap another, it moves there (the old place empty, the tap toggles nothing);
# hold a step and turn PRESETS, it nudges a step at a time (the held key keeps it); stopped, a step held a
# moment plays its note until it is let go, a quick tap doesn't
wait 300
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect page STEPS
key 0 down
wait 50
key 0 up
wait 100
expect steps 1 1
expect stepnote 1 1 60
wait 1500
key 0 down
wait 400
expect meter_min 1 0.002
key 0 up
wait 2500
expect meter_max 1 0.0005
key 0 down
wait 60
key 7 down
wait 60
key 7 up
wait 60
key 0 up
wait 100
expect steps 1 1
expect stepnote 1 1 -1
expect stepnote 1 5 60
key 7 down
wait 60
turn PRESET 1
wait 60
turn PRESET 1
wait 60
key 7 up
wait 100
expect steps 1 1
expect stepnote 1 5 -1
expect stepnote 1 7 60
key 11 down
wait 60
turn PRESET -1
wait 60
key 11 up
wait 100
expect steps 1 1
expect stepnote 1 6 60
key 9 down
wait 60
key 9 up
wait 100
expect steps 1 0
